              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "coldbluegrace"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is excellent Snow Ice Cream! I used my mixer and add the snow into the bowl at the end. I used raspberry preserves, since I did not have frozen berries. This turned out fancy enough to serve at a party or a nice restaurant!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Judy LeMaster"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was such fun to make! I had never made snow ice cream before but we had a perfect heavy snowfall, I had a can of condensed milk and some frozen strawberries and it was New Year's Day! The result was much tastier than I had imagined, and we could store what was left outside overnight in a closed container.",
