              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "chylton"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is YUMMY!! Tastes a lot like homemade ice cream. I was very impressed! Love it and will definitely make again next time it nows. Already looking forward to it.",
            "datePublished": "2018-01-18T17:09:01.670Z"
